"id": "1079493557969152", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593983210_1079493561302485_2934665100945784033_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ojTsv4DwISAQ7kNvwGx7YCZ&_nc_oc=AdpvI51tR_iqLrZ7E9XDvaj8QwR8As_P7niMCVopc6p1vRlO7EBzPwWTM_v1SF7E3gs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJSoYkww239E_Dam5WU5lCbJxmQ_yqgP2lojAPzbhiGGg&oe=6AA01E46"}, {"file_name": "_1.png", "id": "1489553553201786", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623370_1489553556535119_7708937185418211224_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JoFNabrhpa4Q7kNvwEiLHWY&_nc_oc=AdoZYtsD5ytSkMGiRIeMvgTgT1izpmZQYLChavy5FH7723NymrptFbHjaahurj2xCD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLwwjSys6ZRXDWsxObvtcZYEouR-n1iis2vyL5P-OhcFg&oe=6AA013A4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "lanscape.png", "id": "1042204318804274", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1042204322137607_6769175634182158919_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=im-7s4cgMZgQ7kNvwGcu2ao&_nc_oc=AdpP5uo_gCtOqFfYibOjrG29Yh0KpX2ppsD3EuWggqoxsuBjuapVe_VwMceKPcS7Rug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJEHmkN-HdUXOzE1-AMSRhGQZzmzxnCiTxpi8pvumfSpw&oe=6AA02314"}, "display_name": "Beat Blade VR", "keywords": ["rhythm", "sword", "beat", "cyberpunk", "synthwave"], "long_description": "BECOME THE ULTIMATE CYBER BLADE-RUNNER. DANCE WITH DANGER. CRUSH THE TITANS.\n\nBeat Blade VR takes rhythm-action gameplay to the extreme\u2014fusing lightning-fast swordplay, dodging mechanics, and adrenaline-fueled boss showdowns inside a breathtaking 80s synthwave dystopia.\n\nGrab your dual plasma sabers, lock into the flow state, and carve your way through endless crystal swarms to face down colossal cybernetic overlords waiting to test your limits.\n\nCORE GAMEPLAY FEATURES\n\nHigh-Stakes Boss Showdowns: This isn't just about hitting notes\u2014it's a full-blown combat duel. Survive intense bullet-hell patterns, deflect laser attacks, and shatter titan-class bosses waiting at the climax of every track.\n\nPrecision Directional Slashing: Test your reflexes with full 360\u00b0 dynamic slashing. Strike crystal shards along precise directional vectors (Up, Down, Left, Right) to build massive combo multipliers.\n\nPure Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic: Dive deep into a vivid retro-cyberpunk landscape filled with glowing neon grids, surreal wireframe geometry, and driving electronic synth beats.\n\nProgression & Arsenal Unlocks: Gather raw energy cores from fallen bosses to upgrade blade attributes, unlock distinct weapon skins, and access hidden challenge tracks.\n\nCustomizable Difficulty & Modifiers:\n\nMultiple difficulty tiers tailored for casual flow or hardcore endurance.\n\nDeep gameplay modifiers: Toggle hazard walls or bomb spawns to create your ideal practice run or climb the global leaderboards.\n\nOPTIMIZ", "short_description": "Pure rhythm. Relentless speed. Epic boss battles. Strap in for Beat Blade VR\u2014the most intense neon-slashing thrill ride in virtual reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jone Sei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS